      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that, that's actually a really helpful distinction with the natural law stuff. i'll definitely use that. can u do the same for the \"religious liberal\" side? i want to see if they have a similar level of philosophical depth or if it's mostly just based on the idea of compassion and mercy. like, is there a specific theological or ethical framework they use to justify individual autonomy in this way?",
